  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Sometimes I'm in the mood to join some friends to chat. Other times, I want to join to play a game. Or maybe even just a _specific game_. Right now, this process involves clicking through each friend, one by one, until I find one in a world that fits my current mood. That's a lot of clicking.\n\nPlease add an option to group and sort the online friends list by the world they're in (obviously, anyone in a private instance would be grouped under 'private').",
